<title>JAPAN: Kao to draw up more restructuring plans.</title>
<headline>Kao to draw up more restructuring plans.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's leading maker of household products Kao Corp said on Thursday it was restructuring its information-technology business and planning to draw up further drastic restructuring plans by the end of September.</p>
</text>
